00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.910
- So on Paralympic Tennis

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:17.624
the backhand is a little
bit different, is inverted.

00:11:17.624 --> 00:11:20.970
Basically the racket
comes to the back here

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:25.050
